      {"t":"order","p":"the black sweater","a":["il","maglione","nero"],"x":["nera"],"why":"maglione is masculine, so the adjective agrees: nero."},
      {"t":"order","p":"the green shoes","a":["le","scarpe","verdi"],"x":["verde"],"why":"verde ends in -e, so for more than one it becomes verdi: the plural ending is the same for both genders."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"la gonna __","p":"the yellow skirt","a":["gialla"],"o":["giallo","gialle","gialli"],"why":"gonna is feminine and singular: gialla."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"I pantaloni sono __.","p":"The pants are expensive.","a":["cari"],"o":["caro","cara","care"],"why":"pantaloni is masculine plural: cari."},
      {"t":"fill","q":"le borse __","p":"the green bags","a":["verdi"],"o":["verde","verda","verdo"],"why":"verde becomes verdi for more than one."},
      {"t":"type","p":"the white sweaters","a":["i maglioni bianchi"],"hint":"maglione · bianco","x":["bianche"],"why":"maglioni is masculine plural, so the adjective agrees: bianchi."},
      {"t":"type","p":"The jacket is red.","a":["La giacca è rossa."],"hint":"giacca · essere · rosso","x":["rosso"],"why":"giacca is feminine, so the adjective agrees: rossa.","strict":true},
      {"t":"type","p":"Chiara and Giulia are tall.","a":["Chiara e Giulia sono alte."],"hint":"essere · alto","x":["alti"],"why":"Two women: the adjective is feminine plural, alte."}
